# recon: the closed list of states of the machine "Recon draft and critic handoff".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
drafted	initial	waiting	a draft with a recorded report hash waits for its critic
critiqued	-	active	the critic found gaps in that exact draft and the researcher revises
accepted	final	final	the critic found no new gaps in that exact draft
